WEBVTT

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:02.410
Before sorting, check the queue scope.

00:00:02.410 --> 00:00:06.260
Open excludes completed work, while All includes it.

00:00:06.260 --> 00:00:10.020
Open Sort and choose the order that fits the question you're asking.

00:00:10.020 --> 00:00:13.920
For an intake review, compare the newest reports with the oldest ones.

00:00:13.920 --> 00:00:15.720
Watch the first row change.

00:00:15.720 --> 00:00:20.515
Sorting only changes the order; it does not update the status or priority of a ticket.
